docs {
Analitik Notifikasi - Engagement (open rate + durasi dari event notification_open
di GA4 property mobile). Hanya admin & root.

Query: range = 7d | 28d (default) | 90d | custom (wajib start & end YYYY-MM-DD,
end paling lambat kemarin, maks 366 hari).

Status provider (fcm): ok | empty | not_configured | error. Delivery data tetap
dari FCM Data API; opened/open_rate/avg_engagement_seconds dari GA4 (kosong
kalau MOBILE_GA4_PROPERTY_ID / GA4_PROPERTY_ID belum diset).

200 sukses:

    {
      "success": true,
      "data": {
        "section": "engagement",
        "range": { "start": "2026-09-05", "end": "2026-10-02", "previous_start": "2026-08-08", "previous_end": "2026-09-04", "days": 28 },
        "fcm": {
          "status": "ok", "error_code": null, "message": null,
          "range": { "start": "2026-09-05", "end": "2026-10-02" },
          "data": {
            "totals": { "sent": 900, "delivered": 850, "failed": 50, "opened": 180, "open_rate": 0.21 },
            "previous": { "...": "bentuk sama dengan totals" },
            "trend": [{ "date": "2026-09-05", "sent": 32, "delivered": 30, "opened": 7 }],
            "avg_engagement_seconds": 17
          }
        }
      }
    }
}

meta {
  name: Get FCM Analytics Engagement
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/fcm-analytics/engagement?range=28d
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

tests {
  test("status 200 + range resolved", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.success).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data.section).to.equal('engagement');
    expect(res.body.data.range.days).to.equal(28);
  });

  test("status provider dikenal", () => {
    expect(['ok', 'empty', 'not_configured', 'error']).to.include(res.body.data.fcm.status);
  });
}
